<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">As of June&nbsp;30, 2023, the Company had consolidated cash and short term assets of US$214.5&nbsp;million,
comprising cash and cash equivalents totaling US$177.2&nbsp;million, financial assets at fair value through profit or loss of US$13.6&nbsp;million, and trade receivables of US$5.6&nbsp;million, amongst other accounting line items under current
assets. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
</DIV></Center>


